<view class="page config-page">
  <view class="intro-card"><view class="intro-title">统一业务状态通知模板</view><view class="intro-desc">订单、商家入驻、店铺和平台审批共用一个微信订阅消息模板。站内消息不受此配置影响。</view></view>
  <view class="section-title">模板配置</view>
  <view class="form-card config-form">
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">模板ID</text><input class="form-input" placeholder="公众平台订阅消息模板ID" value="{{templateId}}" data-field="templateId" bindinput="onField" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">启用推送</text><switch checked="{{enabled}}" color="#f36a2d" bindchange="onSwitch" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">跳转版本</text><picker class="picker" range="{{stateNames}}" value="{{stateIndex}}" bindchange="onState"><view>{{stateNames[stateIndex]}} ›</view></picker></view>
  </view>
  <view class="section-title field-title">关键词映射</view>
  <view class="field-tip">请根据微信公众平台中实际模板的关键词编号填写。推荐模板字段：通知类型、当前状态、通知时间、通知内容。</view>
  <view class="form-card">
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">通知类型</text><input class="form-input" value="{{titleKey}}" data-field="titleKey" bindinput="onField" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">当前状态</text><input class="form-input" value="{{statusKey}}" data-field="statusKey" bindinput="onField" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">通知时间</text><input class="form-input" value="{{timeKey}}" data-field="timeKey" bindinput="onField" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">通知内容</text><input class="form-input" value="{{remarkKey}}" data-field="remarkKey" bindinput="onField" /></view>
  </view>
  <view class="warning">模板字段的数据类型必须与微信模板一致。默认假设通知类型和通知内容为 thing，当前状态为 phrase，通知时间为 time。</view>
  <view class="primary-btn save-btn" bindtap="save">{{saving ? '保存中…' : '保存统一模板'}}</view>
  <view class="secondary-btn test-btn" bindtap="testSubscribe">测试请求订阅授权</view>
</view>
